{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/blind_wrapped

    The wrapped book of a blind date (Jujol's mock-up of 13 November): Gaudí's drawing of its paper (one of six) when the
    art package has it, else kraft paper and string in CSS; its number always HTML, so that it reads and can be any.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "number": 4, "art": null, "wrappedlabel": "Un libro envuelto para regalo, la cita n.º 4", "small": false,
        "blindnumberabbr": "n.º"
    }
}}
<div class="ayv-cc-envuelto{{#small}} ayv-cc-envuelto-pequeno{{/small}}{{^art}} ayv-cc-envuelto-css{{/art}}" role="img" aria-label="{{wrappedlabel}}">{{#art}}<img src="{{art}}" alt="" width="320" height="480" loading="lazy">{{/art}}{{^art}}<span class="ayv-cc-lazo" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{/art}}<span class="ayv-cc-numero" aria-hidden="true"><small>{{blindnumberabbr}}</small><b>{{number}}</b></span></div>
